[h2]Climb out of a living hell[/h2]
[p][b]EXODUSER: HELL LORD[/b] is a single-player dark fantasy hack-and-slash action RPG. Carve through demon hordes with a greatsword, read incoming bullet patterns, and turn movement, timing and your build into a way out.[/p]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/warrior_motion_20261020"][/img]
[h2]Read the attack. Turn the fight.[/h2]
[p]Enemy projectiles have colors and patterns. Dodge, parry with the matching input, and turn a dangerous barrage into a counterattack. Drive your chain into a wall to cross the battlefield, escape a closing horde, or choose your next angle of attack.[/p]
[h2]Forge your own build[/h2]
[p]Unlock and strengthen skills, then combine compatible techniques at the Skill Forge. Hunt for legendary and unique equipment, compare their effects, and refine your loadout with gems and equipment sockets. Your choices shape how you fight.[/p]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/warrior_story_20261020"][/img]
[h2]A blade. A betrayal. A way home.[/h2]
[p]A blade from behind ended his revenge. He woke at the bottom of hell. His children are still alive on the surface, and the only way back is through. The goddess of vengeance, Nemesia, offers to guide him. Whether her hand is salvation or another trap remains to be seen.[/p]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/nemesia_motion_20261020"][/img]
[p][i]Cinematic sequences and story artwork from EXODUSER.[/i][/p]
[h2]Descend into the world. Fight your way back up.[/h2]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/world_motion_20261020"][/img]
[p]Rotten forests, sealed gates and depths that seem alive. Face hostile regions, enemy hordes and bosses as you climb, with Hector the raven and Diroy the black cat at your side.[/p]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/world_crimson_river_20261020"][/img]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/world_maw_20261020"][/img]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/world_seal_20261020"][/img]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/world_tower_20261020"][/img]
[img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/warrior_cathedral_20261020"][/img]
[h2]What defines the climb[/h2]
[list]
[*]Real-time hack-and-slash combat against demon hordes
[*]Color-coded bullet parrying and direct counterattacks
[*]Chain mobility that uses the battlefield itself
[*]Skill upgrades and fusion at the Skill Forge
[*]Equipment hunting, unique effects and gem sockets
[*]A single-player dark fantasy campaign from FDG (FOR DEAR GAMERS)
[/list]
